Every clinician should review an available low-cost-pain-management-option for a patient.
If a patient has a low-income then every clinician should review an available low-cost-pain-management-option for the patient.
If a patient does not have a health-insurance then every clinician should review an available low-cost-pain-management-option for the patient.
If a patient has an inadequate-insurance then every clinician should review an available low-cost-pain-management-option for the patient.
